### 1. 登录获取 Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "wrongtest1",
  "password": "test12345"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 2. 先查当前自己的错题列表（验证脱敏，期望 200 且包含 6,7,8）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wrong/list?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3. 测试非法排序参数（验证白名单拦截，期望 400）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wrong/list?orderBy=id
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. 测试越权删除（期望 404）
# 执行前，请先在 PowerShell 插入一条属于 user_id=1 的假数据：
# docker exec -it study-mysql mysql -uroot -proot123 study_helper -e "INSERT INTO wrong_book (id, user_id, question_id, wrong_count) VALUES (99, 1, 1, 1);"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wrong/99
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 1. 测试抽题
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wrong/practice?size=2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### 2. 测试提交练习（答对一题，答错一题）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wrong/practice/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 1, "userAnswer": "A" },
    { "questionId": 2, "userAnswer": "C" }
  ]
}


